findings.suggestion:
After acquiring the write lock, re-check if the cache is already populated and return it immediately if so, to avoid redundant work and race conditions. For example, add:

entryPointAssetsCacheMu.Lock()
if entryPointAssetsCache != nil {
    ret := entryPointAssetsCache
    entryPointAssetsCacheMu.Unlock()
    return ret, nil
}
// proceed to load assets
// ...
entryPointAssetsCacheMu.Unlock()
